<Placemark><name>19 → 예루살렘 → 라마 → 바벨론</name><description>남은 백성 포로 — 가장 가난한 자만 남음</description><styleUrl>#lFF4D4D</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>35.23540,31.77810,0 35.23288,31.78146,0 35.23044,31.78487,0 35.22810,31.78831,0 35.22584,31.79180,0 35.22368,31.79532,0 35.22161,31.79889,0 35.21962,31.80249,0 35.21773,31.80614,0 35.21592,31.80982,0 35.21421,31.81355,0 35.21258,31.81731,0 35.21105,31.82112,0 35.20960,31.82496,0 35.20825,31.82885,0 35.20698,31.83277,0 35.20580,31.83674,0 35.20472,31.84074,0 35.20372,31.84479,0 35.20282,31.84887,0 35.20200,31.85300,0 35.65515,31.99227,0 36.10913,32.12047,0 36.56392,32.23761,0 37.01954,32.34369,0 37.47597,32.43870,0 37.93323,32.52265,0 38.39130,32.59554,0 38.85020,32.65737,0 39.30991,32.70813,0 39.77045,32.74783,0 40.23180,32.77647,0 40.69398,32.79405,0 41.15697,32.80056,0 41.62079,32.79601,0 42.08542,32.78040,0 42.55088,32.75373,0 43.01715,32.71599,0 43.48425,32.66719,0 43.95216,32.60733,0 44.42090,32.53640,0</coordinates></LineString><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>44.42090,32.53640,0 44.36436,32.57285,0 44.35345,32.51727,0 44.42090,32.53640,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
